---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions — AcePharm"
  description="The terms for using AcePharm. These terms explain account responsibilities, subscriptions, acceptable use, educational limitations and how AcePharm content may be used."
>
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50/40 to-canvas border-b border-border-subtle text-center px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-primary font-semibold">The terms for using AcePharm.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        These terms explain account responsibilities, subscriptions, acceptable use, educational limitations and how AcePharm content may be used.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-8 text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed">
    <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs leading-relaxed">
      <strong>Educational disclaimer:</strong> AcePharm is an educational resource. It does not provide patient-specific medical advice and does not replace official guidance, university teaching, professional supervision, clinical judgement or local policies.
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">1. Subscriptions & Billing</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-muted">Monthly subscriptions renew automatically on their monthly anniversary; yearly subscriptions renew annually. You can cancel at any time via your account settings. Access persists until the end of your prepaid billing period.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-muted">All questions, clinical vignettes, rationales, calculations, and software algorithms are the proprietary property of AcePharm. Content may not be scraped, redistributed, or reproduced without written consent.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
